  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dream Big. Play Loud. Kick On.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural partnership and building bridges between nations and generations is high on Denmark&#x2019;s agenda for the future partnership with Tanzania. &#x2018;Dream Big. Play Loud. Kick On.&#x2019; will be a scene setter for this partnership which will build on the two countries&#x2019; existing deep people to people connections, signal continued dialogue, and create a strong sense of the Danish-Tanzanian linkages. By targeting music and football &#x2013; two vital elements of Tanzanian culture &#x2013; the project will demonstrate the role of culture in building social cohesion and in empowering young girls and boys.</narrative>
  </description>
